<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Allegiance Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Allegiance Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it initiated coverage of Allegiance Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $31 a share.</p>
<p>-- expects Allegiance will achieve net income growth of about 36 percent for 1997 and 11 percent for 1998.</p>
<p>-- expects Allegiance to earn $1.56 a share in 1997 and $1.72  a share in 1998, excluding acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- Allegiance lost 1/8 to 23-3/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
